;; tags: int-arith, bitwise
;; expect: 102
;; Bitwise exclusive-or. AArch64 EOR Xd, Xn, Xm. 0xAA ^ 0xCC == 0x66 == 102.
;; This pair has interesting carry/borrow behavior under add/sub so it
;; doubles as a sanity check that XOR codegen doesn't lose to ADD.
(defun main ()
  (format #t "~D~%" (logxor #xAA #xCC)))
